values ('bbbb0005-0000-4000-8000-000000000018', 'en', null, 'The 20th Century: A Global History', 'A global survey of the twentieth century, from the empires and industrial power of 1900 through two world wars, revolution, depression, decolonization, the Cold War, and the globalized world of the century''s end. Structure and sequence adapted from OpenStax World History (CC BY 4.0), with original prose and a deliberately global, not only Western, perspective.', null, 'foundations', 70, true, 'humanities', '{}')
